Getting Started

Create the PostgreSQL database using the following command:

`sql
CREATE DATABASE novabank;
`

Connect to the database and run the SQL scripts in the portfolio-1-database-design/ folder.

Each of the other folders in this repository will contain the files for each of the portfolio activities.

Documentation and AI Use

The final project report will contain documentation of the implementation of the NovaBank database systems, as well as the challenges faced during the project.

AI tools will be used during the course of the project to help plan the database, explain technical concepts, debug any issues in the code, or to document the project. All implementations submitted as part of this portfolio will be independently verified by the student.

Project Status

In Progress: Database Design and Modelling.

All other activities will be completed as the implementation progresses.
